<odoo>

    <record id="ranging_great" model="nw.ranging">
        <field name="name">The Great Ranging</field>
        <field name="status">returned</field>
        <field name="castle_id" ref="castle_black"/>
        <field name="threat_id" ref="threat_others"/>
        <field name="leader_id" ref="brother_mormont"/>
        <field name="brother_ids" eval="[Command.set([
            ref('brother_mormont'),
            ref('brother_jon'),
            ref('brother_sam'),
            ref('brother_grenn'),
            ref('brother_thorne'),
            ref('brother_qhorin'),
            ref('brother_dalbridge'),
            ref('brother_ebben'),
            ref('brother_stonesnake'),
        ])]"/>
        <field name="casualty_ids" eval="[Command.set([ref('brother_qhorin')])]"/>
        <field name="date_start">2024-10-01</field>
        <field name="date_end">2024-12-18</field>
        <field name="objective">Find out what became of Benjen Stark's rangers and confirm the sightings reported by the Free Folk.</field>
        <field name="summary" type="html">
            <p>Two hundred rode north from Castle Black. The party reached the
            Fist of the First Men and held it through the first snows. Qhorin
            Halfhand fell in the Skirling Pass covering the scouts' retreat.</p>
        </field>
    </record>

    <record id="ranging_benjen" model="nw.ranging">
        <field name="name">Benjen Stark's Ranging</field>
        <field name="status">ongoing</field>
        <field name="castle_id" ref="castle_black"/>
        <field name="threat_id" ref="threat_free_folk"/>
        <field name="leader_id" ref="brother_benjen"/>
        <field name="brother_ids" eval="[Command.set([ref('brother_benjen')])]"/>
        <field name="date_start">2024-08-14</field>
        <field name="objective">Scout the haunted forest for signs of the King-Beyond-the-Wall.</field>
    </record>

    <record id="ranging_fist" model="nw.ranging">
        <field name="name">Patrol to the Fist of the First Men</field>
        <field name="status">planned</field>
        <field name="castle_id" ref="castle_black"/>
        <field name="threat_id" ref="threat_free_folk"/>
        <field name="leader_id" ref="brother_jon"/>
        <field name="brother_ids" eval="[Command.set([
            ref('brother_jon'),
            ref('brother_grenn'),
            ref('brother_pyp'),
        ])]"/>
        <field name="date_start">2025-03-05</field>
        <field name="objective">Re-establish the outpost on the Fist and leave a cache of supplies.</field>
    </record>

    <record id="ranging_benjen" model="nw.ranging">
        <field name="name">Benjen Stark's Ranging</field>
        <field name="status">ongoing</field>
        <field name="castle_id" ref="castle_black"/>
        <field name="threat_id" ref="threat_free_folk"/>
        <field name="leader_id" ref="brother_benjen"/>
        <field name="brother_ids" eval="[Command.set([
            ref('brother_benjen'),
            ref('brother_othor'),
            ref('brother_jafer'),
        ])]"/>
        <field name="casualty_ids" eval="[Command.set([
            ref('brother_othor'),
            ref('brother_jafer'),
        ])]"/>
        <field name="date_start">2026-04-14</field>
        <field name="objective">Scout the haunted forest for signs of the King-Beyond-the-Wall.</field>
        <field name="summary" type="html">
            <p>Six men rode north with the First Ranger. The bodies of Othor and
            Jafer Flowers were found beyond the Wall and carried back to Castle
            Black, six days dead and showing no sign of rot. Benjen Stark and the
            rest have not been seen since.</p>
        </field>
    </record>

    <record id="ranging_waymar" model="nw.ranging">
        <field name="name">Ser Waymar's Patrol</field>
        <field name="status">lost</field>
        <field name="castle_id" ref="castle_black"/>
        <field name="threat_id" ref="threat_others"/>
        <field name="leader_id" ref="brother_waymar"/>
        <field name="brother_ids" eval="[Command.set([
            ref('brother_waymar'),
            ref('brother_will'),
            ref('brother_gared'),
        ])]"/>
        <field name="casualty_ids" eval="[Command.set([
            ref('brother_waymar'),
            ref('brother_will'),
        ])]"/>
        <field name="date_start">2026-05-02</field>
        <field name="date_end">2026-05-04</field>
        <field name="objective">Track a band of wildlings reported a half-day north of the Wall.</field>
        <field name="summary" type="html">
            <p>Ser Waymar led two seasoned men against their counsel and would
            not turn back. He was cut down in the snow. Gared alone came south,
            and did not stop at Castle Black.</p>
        </field>
    </record>

</odoo>
